  "explanation": "User wants to CREATE a new project with multiple tasks. Key points: (1) 'tasks' is an ARRAY of strings, use square brackets: [\"task1\", \"task2\", \"task3\"], (2) 'priority' should be 'high' (lowercase, from enum), (3) 'assignees' is optional so we can omit it. Make sure to extract all three task names from the query.",
  
